🎧 Global Digital Music Store Analytics Summary

This project leverages SQL queries to derive actionable insights from a global digital music store database. The analysis is divided into key business objectives across leadership, revenue, customer behavior, and genre performance.

⸻

🔹 1. Leadership Insight

Objective: Identify the most senior employee in the organization.
Result: Pulled the top employee based on organizational level to understand the leadership structure.

⸻

🌍 2. Top Performing Country by Invoices

Objective: Determine which country has the highest number of transactions.
Result: Aggregated invoice counts by country to locate the most active customer region.

⸻

💰 3. High-Value Transactions

Objective: Track the top 3 invoices with the highest purchase totals.
Result: Sorted and retrieved the highest sales to monitor big-ticket transactions.

⸻

🏙️ 4. Best City for Promotional Event

Objective: Choose the city generating the highest total revenue.
Result: Grouped and ranked cities by total invoice amounts to target future marketing efforts.

⸻

🧑‍💼 5. Top-Spending Customer

Objective: Identify the customer who has spent the most overall.
Result: Summed all invoices per customer and sorted to find the most valuable client.

⸻

🎸 6. Rock Music Audience Segmentation

Objective: Find customers who purchase Rock music.
Result: Filtered customer emails and names by Rock genre purchases for targeted campaigns.

⸻

🎤 7. Top Rock Artists

Objective: Identify leading Rock artists based on track volume.
Result: Counted tracks per artist within the Rock genre and ranked them.

⸻

⏱️ 8. Long-Form Track Opportunities

Objective: Spot tracks that are longer than average duration.
Result: Identified extended tracks for playlists, niche promotions, or editorial curation.

⸻

🎧 9. Customer Spend by Artist

Objective: Calculate how much each customer has spent on each artist.
Result: Used aggregation and joins to analyze cross-customer artist revenue.

⸻

📊 10. Popular Genre by Country

Objective: Determine the most popular music genre per country.
Result: Applied ranking logic to find the top-selling genre in each region.

⸻

🏆 11. Top Customer per Country

Objective: Identify the highest-spending customer in each country.
Result: Ranked customers by total purchases within each country for loyalty program insights.

⸻

✅ Use Cases for These Insights
	•	Marketing Strategy: Identify where and whom to target based on genre, location, and spending behavior.
	•	Revenue Optimization: Focus promotions in high-revenue cities and around high-value customers.
	•	Product Development: Develop more long-form tracks or artist features based on customer demand.
